hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27554","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, he said: Shubah narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn al-Numan, he said: I heard Talhah al-Ayyami narrate, and Yahya ibn Said, from Shubah, he said: Muhammad ibn al-Numan informed me, from Talhah ibn Musarrif, from a woman of Banu Abd al-Qays, from the sister of Abdullah ibn Rawahah al-Ansari, from the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, that he said: Going out is obligatory upon every woman of childbearing age."
